flowchart TD
  Operator["Operator / application"] -->|authorize bounded task| Dispatch["Dispatch intent<br/>identity · scope · policy"]
  Dispatch --> Envelope["Signed authority envelope<br/>task + capability context"]
  Envelope --> Transport["Authenticated transport<br/>Fabric direction · private"]
  Transport --> Verify["Runner verifies identity<br/>and requested authority"]
  Verify -->|permitted| Execute["Execute bounded work<br/>on authorized machine"]
  Verify -->|reject / unavailable| Deny["Visible denial or failure"]
  Execute --> Events["Structured result / event"]
  Events --> Review["Return for application<br/>and operator review"]
  Deny --> Review
  Review -. "additional product evidence required" .-> Audit["No public deployment<br/>or operator setup"]
